  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.03 Issuance of Original Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.03 Issuance of Original Certificate.\n\n(a) An applicant who meets the educational and certification requirements, pursuant to Saf-C 4903 and who submits a completed application, pursuant to Saf-C 4904.01, shall be issued a pocket card and wall certificate.\n\n(b) The pocket card, DSFM 88, and wall certificate, DSFM 89, shall contain the following:\n\n(1) The individual’s name;\n\n(2) The certificate number;\n\n(3) The type of certificate;\n\n(4) The date of issuance; and\n\n(5) The expiration date of the certificate.\n\n(c) All certificates issued shall expire on the last day of the applicant’s birth month, 2 years from the date of issuance.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; amd by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
